OVERVIEW: Interact with Apple Developer Services

USAGE: xtool ds <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  teams                   Interact with development teams
  certificates            Interact with certificates
  identifiers             Interact with bundle identifiers
  devices                 Interact with devices
  profiles                Interact with profiles
  anisette                Test out Anisette data

  See 'xtool help ds <subcommand>' for detailed help.
